# 行尾单一事实源：文本一律 LF 入库、LF 检出，规则随仓库走、与各人 core.autocrlf 解耦，
# 杜绝「status 标 M 而 diff 为空」的行尾假性脏状态
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保持 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 二进制资产禁止归一化
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.node binary
*.zip binary
*.7z binary
*.asar binary
*.pdf binary
